OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged following armed bus
OL,4,Ahijacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 39-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fa number of offences after a bus was
OL,8,Fhijacked in County Tyrone on Saturday.
OL,10,FThe driver of the bus was threatened at
OL,11,Fknife point by a man, who then allowed
OL,12,Fpassengers to leave the bus. However,
OL,13,Fthe bus driver was kept on board.
OL,15,FThe charges include kidnapping,
OL,16,Fhijacking, aggravated vehicle taking
OL,17,Fcausing injury and possession of an
OL,18,Foffensive weapon.
OL,20,FThe man will appear before Enniskillen
OL,21,FMagistrates Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
